<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1夜.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Moonlight lit up the settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Tomorrow, Shiyo 800, April 8, is a full moon. Tonight is just as bright."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, there's lots of bumps around there, so watch your step! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Over there, tree roots are sticking out! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　And around there, there's lots of puddles from the rain the other day!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-410\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n-410\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"At this rate, looks like I don't even need to show the way."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> bounced along ahead of us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Don't get too far ahead!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
We gradually made our way into the deep forest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> had gone off somewhere before we knew it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Where'd </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> get to...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
