<STYLE ID="2">"Boo!!!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Whoa-whoaaa!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> appeared right in front of us.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahahahaha!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
